The device plugin advertises the card to the scheduler but exports no metrics:
no utilisation, VRAM, temperature, power or per-pod attribution. NVIDIA's DCGM
exporter fills the gap. See `docs/RUNBOOKS.md` § Adding DCGM GPU telemetry for
